{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.poster.avif?t=1766178863\" aria-label=\"A slow, suspenseful pan through a mid-90s suburban dining and living room, steeped in darkness, ends on a boxy television set flickering with a regional weather forecast.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.webm?t=1766178863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976990/extras/d136f7ee6a02d93776c68cded0904343.mp4?t=1766178863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grandma has changed\u2014and not for the better. Tonight, something ancient takes hold of her, twisting her into a vessel for the Devil itself. Before the darkness fully claims her, she leaves you one final warning: whatever you do\u2026 <strong>DON\u2019T LOOK AT GRANDMA.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside, descend into Grandpa\u2019s hidden chamber, and attempt the ritual that might save her soul\u2014if you can make it through the night.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform the Ritual</strong> \u2013 Search every shelf, drawer, closet, and cabinet for five sacred heirlooms needed to banish the Devil and save Grandma's soul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Look at Grandma</strong> \u2013 The Devil only wins if you make eye contact, and Grandma has a way of appearing where you least expect her...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets Beneath the House</strong> \u2013 Discover the origins of a generational curse and uncover long-buried truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Horror</strong> \u2013 Each run reveals 